{"steam_appid":3769130,"steam_name":"Keep on Mining!","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3769130/827488160/fb386c93f13dd36161e748f4847057e2dcfeee52/1750380416/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750009837","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157090/4052a0ed05ef3a2f26d9c8d2b7e6e0c0a94584bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750009837","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/87ef4c9be1390974eb59d2b239612a6ff1891cb5/ss_87ef4c9be1390974eb59d2b239612a6ff1891cb5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779084143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/c02dbc0ad92627f6f1b8e2df6b6302462f7b8aab/ss_c02dbc0ad92627f6f1b8e2df6b6302462f7b8aab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779084143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/81c160792fc863e9af6431d88b90a1a7b9a209a1/ss_81c160792fc863e9af6431d88b90a1a7b9a209a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779084143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/200bf0ed4aecfed8f5029026589960f2a5f83773/ss_200bf0ed4aecfed8f5029026589960f2a5f83773.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779084143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/ff4bb834984fbe3b5b6af3e55995c2fa51426edf/ss_ff4bb834984fbe3b5b6af3e55995c2fa51426edf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779084143"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine rocks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.poster.avif?t=1779084143\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.webm?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.mp4?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep on Mining! is a simple incremental game. Hover your cursor over rocks to automatically mine them. Any rock inside the mining area will spawn pickaxes that mine for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather materials!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.poster.avif?t=1779084143\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.webm?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.mp4?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mined rocks drop ores, which are crafted into bars. There is a variety of different material rocks to be mined!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The skill tree!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.poster.avif?t=1779084143\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.webm?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.mp4?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your material bars to unlock upgrades inside the skill tree. These upgrades permanently boost your stats, letting you mine rocks with more power!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft pickaxes! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.poster.avif?t=1779084143\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.webm?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.mp4?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different materials to craft new pickaxes. Each new pickaxe has better stats, helping you mine faster and hit harder!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talent cards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.poster.avif?t=1779084143\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.webm?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.mp4?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you earn a talent point. Spend talent points to reveal 3 random talent cards — pick one to keep! Choosing a card increases the talent level, but also increases rock HP.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Mine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.poster.avif?t=1779084143\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.webm?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.mp4?t=1779084143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you unlock the mine, it will automatically mine rocks and instantly craft bars for you. The Mine is the idle mechanic of Keep on Mining!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie"],"developers":["EagleEye Games"],"publishers":["EagleEye Games"],"release_date":"30 Jul, 2025"}